# TeaVM declares some JDK methods under another name plus @Rename (TThrowable.getMessage0 ->
# getMessage, TObject.getClass0 -> getClass, getCause, getStackTrace, ...). StdlibConverter exported them
# under the TeaVM-side name, so javac said 'cannot find symbol: method getMessage()'. Now plain method
# renames are applied to the SDK stubs (constructor/init swaps are left alone).
#
# Applies to: github.com/konsoletyper/teavm-javac 2ddcf02e (master, 2026-09-04)

